    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bathysphere</i> is a <strong>horror adventure-strategy </strong>game<strong>\u00a0</strong>set within the confines of a small submersible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based death game unfolds in the ocean\u2019s depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must discover your enemy's location before they discover yours. Strategically fire sonar pulses and hide among the seafloor terrain. Only by winning can you descend to the next layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A twisted spacetime and the mysteries of the deep sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to break the endless cycle and escape. Explore the ocean depths, read documents, and uncover the truth behind the time loop you're stuck in. The devices inside the bathysphere aren\u2019t all just for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The analog technology from the 1940s and the tense deep-sea action draws you in to the game world. Unravel the secrets of the vessel filled with strange machinery. If you don\u2019t think, you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bathysphere</i> is a <strong>horror adventure-strategy </strong>game<strong>\u00a0</strong>set within the confines of a small submersible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based death game unfolds in the ocean\u2019s depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must discover your enemy's location before they discover yours. Strategically fire sonar pulses and hide among the seafloor terrain. Only by winning can you descend to the next layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/cffd9a5020052bdb068f666b913a2ec2.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A twisted spacetime and the mysteries of the deep sea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to break the endless cycle and escape. Explore the ocean depths, read documents, and uncover the truth behind the time loop you're stuck in. The devices inside the bathysphere aren\u2019t all just for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/7cd4fc57cccaa8871ba459f871d42fe9.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The analog technology from the 1940s and the tense deep-sea action draws you in to the game world. Unravel the secrets of the vessel filled with strange machinery. If you don\u2019t think, you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.poster.avif?t=1754752787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.webm?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192130/extras/6d565eb2f8bfe2e9c397963ea25a2e4b.mp4?t=1754752787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
